The files in data/samples/ are taken from the artefact of:

  Pan, R. et al. (2024). Lost in Translation: A Study of Bugs Introduced by
  Large Language Models while Translating Code. ICSE 2024.
  https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.10447705

Licensed under CC BY 4.0: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Changes made by this project: programs were selected and copied into one
folder each, renamed to source.py and translation.java. Pan et al.'s bug
labels were converted to JSON in meta.json, the bug_lines and notes fields
were added for hand-tagging.
